  "prediction": "The report provides an overview of the Temporary Assistance for Needy Families (TANF) block grant, including state-level data and responses to frequently asked questions. TANF is funded through a combination of federal and state funds, with a basic block grant of $16.5 billion in FY2018. The report notes that the real value of the TANF block grant has declined by 36% since FY1997 due to inflation. In FY2017, a total of $31.1 billion was expended on TANF and state maintenance of effort (MOE) funds. TANF is used for various purposes, including basic assistance, child care, and work-related activities. The report also discusses the history of TANF, including its creation in 1996 and the decline in real value of the block grant over time. The report does not provide information on TANF program rules. The report includes several tables with state-level data on TANF expenditures and caseloads.",
  "scored_prediction": "The report provides an overview of the Temporary Assistance for Needy Families (TANF) block grant, including state-level data and responses to frequently asked questions. TANF is funded through a combination of federal and state funds, with a basic block grant of $16.5 billion in FY2018. The report notes that the real value of the TANF block grant has declined by 36% since FY1997 due to inflation. In FY2017, a total of $31.1 billion was expended on TANF and state maintenance of effort (MOE) funds. TANF is used for various purposes, including basic assistance, child care, and work-related activities. The report also discusses the history of TANF, including its creation in 1996 and the decline in real value of the block grant over time. The report does not provide information on TANF program rules. The report includes several tables with state-level data on TANF expenditures and caseloads.",
